================================================================================
Third-party software
================================================================================

This product is a thin bridge over Meta's Wearables Device Access Toolkit
(DAT) 1.0.0. Meta's SDKs are closed-source binaries that are linked as
dependencies at build time. They are NOT redistributed by this repository or
by the published package, and they remain under Meta's own license terms
(see the LICENSE file of each upstream repository and the Meta Wearables
Developer Terms at https://wearables.developer.meta.com/terms). The MIT
License of this product does not apply to them.

