Meta Wearables Device Access Toolkit (iOS)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:   https://github.com/facebook/meta-wearables-dat-ios
Version:  1.0.0 (Swift Package Manager, pinned exactly)
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
Licensed under Meta's license terms found in the LICENSE file of the upstream
